es findings on sunk cost bias and adaptive planning to propose criteria for the rational abandonment of research agendas, emphasizing the need to decouple previous investments from future strategic utility.", "title": "Rational Decision Criteria for Question Abandonment"}, {"id": "nb-reasoning-limits-001", "project": "p-reasoning-limits-001", "provenance": ["source-bda2bc47c38c47a2", "source-db145486024f469a", "source-f955850b0fcf467a"], "revision": 5, "summary": "This revised notebook synthesizes the current state of cognitive architecture literature, focusing on structural patterns and self-monitoring capabilities.", "title": "Provisional Review: Architectural Consensus and Self-Monitoring"}], "retrieval_triggers": ["material belief revision or retraction", "new contradiction or counterevidence", "high-consequence decision", "request for justification", "sign that an excerpt may hide a material distinction"]}}, "prev_hash": "c32bca259f376997b74483108c49d211a468e89a5d07e5ed7e89521f51d2542c", "hash": "171b85ddb13999f2ef0ea1c9da1c39adc13a172d5aff9b2db1f8814cc91c2ce3"}, "projection_only": true, "projection_id": "103.wake::171b85ddb13999f2ef0ea1c9da1c39adc13a172d5aff9b2db1f8814cc91c2ce3"}, {"seq": 4470, "time": "2026-11-13T22:29:20.483830+00:00", "kind": "provider_attempt_started", "payload": {"attempt": {"http_status": null, "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "provider_input_chars": 49667, "provider_input_hash": "ae0f11f8e7bf673bb4ae1d6e290a6845fe1c1cdb715b4e5a706bc3fa278ec05f", "result": "unknown"}, "id": "103.wake::w-e8b86ff0956846f0"}, "prev_hash": "171b85ddb13999f2ef0ea1c9da1c39adc13a172d5aff9b2db1f8814cc91c2ce3", "hash": "0b8b2d06ea369e758cf167cd9dd336fa141e09b067df923bf34ac77e931313df", "origin": {"node": "103.wake", "head": "3d387eda8c0dada31347ae77c6ea10031c6757cca2363642d658145484d4e3cc", "version": 98}, "original_event": {"seq": 4470, "time": "2026-11-13T22:29:20.483830+00:00", "kind": "provider_attempt_started", "payload": {"attempt": {"http_status": null, "